 *
 * **A branch with no fixture is a branch nothing here can tell you about**, so
 * the rule when adding one is the rule `TemplateRenderTest` already states —
 * populate the awkward case, not the convenient one. A panel rendered with
 * every optional value null has not been rendered.
 *
 * @return array<string, array{0: string, 1: array<string, mixed>}>
 */
